1
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:09,380
Rates & Charts lists every instrument with live bid, ask, spread, high and low, rollover and break times.

2
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:17,520
The keys shown here work on the selected row: R rate, N negotiation, G range, H high/low, I interest, C chart.

3
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,650
Rate opens Change Price.

4
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:26,510
Set a new bid or ask, the spread, the feed mode and source, or shift the feed price.

5
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:30,170
The quick buttons move the price by whole pips.

6
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:38,960
Apply sends it to every trader at once. We close without changing anything.

7
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:49,850
Neg. sets negotiation for the instrument: Auto fills at once, Value and Full need your confirmation.

8
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:57,890
Set Range is the dealer range in pips for the instrument.

9
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:08,560
Right-click for more: chart, order depth, price alert, high/low and rollover interest.

10
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:21,740
View on Chart opens a live chart of the instrument.

11
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:30,580
Order Depth shows pending orders by price, buy on the left and sell on the right.

